{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-01_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-01","title":"Consolation","storyCode":"4-1","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f621cca8a5edb6eb24ba021198f6a38c8cccb37c6e7e7baad9792eb46eab7b4e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十一关（前）\n8:36 P.M. \\ Rainy \\ Visibility: 12 km\nRhodes Island"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Welcome back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Mm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I already heard what happened from the recon squad."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, let me check your hands."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There's no need for that, Dr. Kal'tsit..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I, I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...All right."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"It looks fine. The rings haven't cracked or discolored."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"But it might be different next time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Listen closely, Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Be a little more careful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Kal'tsit, I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...I need some rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Go ahead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Never put Amiya in this much risk again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"You are also responsible for what happened."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"When you first came back to Rhodes Island, she looked a bit like this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"These emotions never really left Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"This has to change."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...Dr. {@nickname}, you should stay with her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't mess up."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"*knock* *knock*","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's open."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Worried? I am?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...You saw right through me, hehe..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I thought I did a good job hiding it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, I'm a bit worried... just a little, though."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm already used to doing this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"After all, I can't drag down everyone else any more."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Right, Doctor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...I don't understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor... I don't understand."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"(Stay silent)","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No, I... I know what we're trying to do. I also know... that some sacrifices are inevitable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But I... what I don't know is..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why must I watch people disappear before my eyes one by one... even though they can be saved?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We were so close... Maybe just a little bit more..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know that I have a duty... and I will continue to move forward..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But right now... I just feel so tired."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Amiya...","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Please let me have some time alone, Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, Dr. Kal'tsit, you're here as well?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I have a rather urgent mission here, and need some people to help out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"An abandoned city was discovered not far from Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I surmise that it's one of the cities that formed in the aftermath of the Chernobog incident."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll have to explore that city, uncover more information, and search for any survivors."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"If the situation is particularly serious, for example, if Reunion is hiding there, then there may be serious ramifications on our future operations."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Here's the specific proposal that I have in mind. Look over it when you have time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, one more thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka submitted a report to me mentioning that they had to return to Blacksteel."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"As for the situation in the Lungmen slums, Penguin Logistics requested for you to meet them there to discuss some information."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"There are some more sensitive details, so it'd be best for you to go in person."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know. I'll head over right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, let's go--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I still have some things to discuss with Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"May I listen in?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"You may not."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can cover my ears..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"You cannot. You should get going."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aww..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Kal'tsit, you're not allowed to bully Dr. {@nickname}."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"You couldn't even do something so basic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Forget it, I had a feeling this would happen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya is an incredibly resilient kid."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"But, if she has to force herself to be strong, there will come a day when the pressure breaks her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Do not let this happen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"If there is a next time, you'd better be a little more useful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"--?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"What's with that face?"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Excuse me, but what do you mean by Amiya's rings...?","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"It's related to the state of her health."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"If Amiya is involved in an intense battle..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...You must check her rings immediately afterwards."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter what changes you see, you must report them to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"For the time being, that's all you're allowed to know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, right. You have to go down to the medical center in two days to have a physical done. Don't forget it."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...You can go. Liskarm is waiting outside to escort you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"...","value":"2","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["Kal'tsit"]}]}
